---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Abhyas handles your data, cookies and local storage." path="/privacy-policy/">
  <section class="wrap sec"><div class="prose">
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Abhyas does not ask you to create an account and does not collect your name, email or phone number.</p>
<h2>Data stored on your device</h2>
<p>To work properly the site saves test progress, results, saved questions, language and theme choice in your browser storage. This data stays on your device. You can delete it any time from the My progress page or by clearing your browser data. A service worker also keeps copies of visited pages so they open offline.</p>
<h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
<p>If advertisements are shown, they are served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to show ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can manage personalised ads in your Google ad settings or at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--brand)">policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.</p>
<h2>Hosting logs</h2>
<p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may keep standard server logs such as IP address and browser type.</p>
<h2>Children</h2>
<p>The site is meant for exam aspirants. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update this policy. The latest version is always on this page. Questions can be sent through the contact page.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
